6c18313aed263edb401502cc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e60ecfd7/uploads/origins/734afd12-ca76-400e-8bf3-4fd48055ef8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=10550bd56c18313aed263edb401502cc, https://si.imgix.net/e60ecfd7/uploads/origins/734afd12-ca76-400e-8bf3-4fd48055ef8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d731e708066d1de5365d7b9781bb169d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e60ecfd7/uploads/origins/734afd12-ca76-400e-8bf3-4fd48055ef8c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4b59b0712b0198bd1ea3f77ee588c90a 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I absolutely love your art style and would love to request an illustration of my VTuber character! She's a cat god streaming in a bright, colorful post-apocalyptic world inspired by “Zom100” and “Words Bubble Up Like Soda Water!” I'll leave the pose and composition to you! Please make it colorful and pack it full of cute jirai kei, decora, and yamikawaii design elements—cute eyeballs, cats, bells, confetti, candy, colorful blood, frills, etc.! \n\nPersonality is spoiled and a bit bratty, but still adorable! A mix of horror and cuteness!! \n\nThanks for checking out the design! <33 \n\nIf possible, please also provide a .psd file, or versions with and without the background! This will be used on my streams and SNS.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hM3K2_PMZAXTonVE9xbgp7zp8Km6FlTx\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hM3K2_PMZAXTonVE9xbgp7zp8Km6FlTx", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yokota_nemu/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3826638, "client_id": 3458827, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/458a8842/uploads/origins/adc6518d-7c0d-4f65-a747-0442a7055f2e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=2